{
	"name": "PL_Bronze_to_Silver_quarantine_INCREMENTAL",
	"properties": {
		"description": "Processes the current ST37 Bronze WindowKey into Silver and Quarantine. Industry-refactor v1: classification predicates are defined once inside the transform Script and reused for both CETAS writes and returned counts; SilverCount/QuarantineCount/SilverHasRows are propagated downstream without rescanning Silver/Quarantine storage. Existing child-level failure logging and lineage are preserved. FINAL V2: returns SilverCount/QuarantineCount/SilverHasRows and centralizes operational failure logging through PL_Common_Error_Handler. Instrumentation V3: transformation StartTime/EndTime persisted; existing single-pass Silver/Quarantine counts retained.",
